    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1275">

                <pb facs="0879" n="763" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg763"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/15.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to Consul Alger.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-10-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 8, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your October 6th. Informally protest to Riveros against forced loan from Rosario
                    Mining Company.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
